{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/2f86030dd427c3f443253a6dc27408c3.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jerry The Zombie Slayer</strong> is a <strong>unique roguelite</strong>, full of <strong>action</strong>, <strong>absurd humor</strong> and hordes of <strong>bloodthirsty zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, loot, and craft as you fight to survive.\u00a0<strong>Die a thousand times\u2026</strong> but don\u2019t worry, <strong>Doc Dick</strong>, the <strong>mad scientist</strong>, will always bring you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/4f19bd638a932db7ff88b80a0f1ad332.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/8d64d53e61ce37092633bd9880435b3c.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/8d64d53e61ce37092633bd9880435b3c.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/8d64d53e61ce37092633bd9880435b3c.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose from hundreds of weapons:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee weapons</strong>\u00a0- Machetes, <strong>Katanas</strong>, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handguns</strong>\u00a0- Pistols, Revolvers, and SMGs (<strong>UZI</strong>!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assault Rifles</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>AK-47</strong>, FAMAS, M4, <strong>AUG</strong>, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy weapons</strong>\u00a0- Machine Guns (<strong>MiniGun</strong>!) and Shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special weapons</strong>\u00a0- Bows, Crossbows, <strong>Flamethrowers</strong>, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>So much firepower that only Jerry can carry it all\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udcaa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/5cfe9a3081e6c23c080785d5b6e0dbf3.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/67d3f9d9b771a5fa0bc1a7ecd652c629.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/67d3f9d9b771a5fa0bc1a7ecd652c629.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/67d3f9d9b771a5fa0bc1a7ecd652c629.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>twisted zombies</strong> to <strong>mutated spiders</strong> and <strong>massive horrors</strong>, every <strong>boss</strong> is a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat them</strong> to get <strong>better loot</strong>, <strong>earn experience</strong>, and <strong>unlock new areas</strong> to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The next time you face a boss, it will be <strong>tougher</strong> and may surprise you with <strong>new attacks</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/ae7894fda4e49e29cd50c63c4c77e8fb.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/a914caa1426136c4f03829fdc6ca759e.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/a914caa1426136c4f03829fdc6ca759e.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/a914caa1426136c4f03829fdc6ca759e.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player progres:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect XP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LV UP</strong> and\u00a0<strong>choose upgrades: attack</strong>, <strong>defense</strong>, <strong>speed</strong>\u2026 or try something completely <strong>different</strong>? <br>The <strong>choice is yours</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/2095f57ee6795645cb146870b3eb9c61.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/c781cceb1149b15dedb2414b926e564f.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/c781cceb1149b15dedb2414b926e564f.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/c781cceb1149b15dedb2414b926e564f.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every <strong>run</strong>, you <strong>collect resources</strong> and  you can <strong>build new structures</strong> or <strong>upgrade</strong> the ones you already have. <strong>Upgrading buildings</strong> not only <strong>unlocks new crafting recipes</strong>, but also <strong>improves</strong> your existing <strong>special gear</strong> and <strong>weapons</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/fa07bdd2784e4798877942aad79013f6.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/26ad33be1d9f820d82e335f8a2ab2da2.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/26ad33be1d9f820d82e335f8a2ab2da2.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/26ad33be1d9f820d82e335f8a2ab2da2.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your <strong>adventures</strong>, you\u2019ll <strong>find materials</strong> that allow you to <strong>craft unique equipment</strong> (<strong>Special Gear</strong>):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offensive Gear</strong> (Mines, <strong>Dynamite</strong>, and much more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong> (e.g. <strong>monkey</strong> decoys that <strong>lure</strong> zombies and give you a moment to breathe)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing Gear</strong> (Various <strong>healing</strong> items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong> (e.g. slowing traps, <strong>freezing traps</strong>, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is just the beginning -\u00a0the game<strong> is packed </strong>with<strong> tons of weird and unexpected gear </strong>waiting to be<strong> discovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/2f86030dd427c3f443253a6dc27408c3.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s just the beginning. Join <strong>Jerry</strong> as he fights through the <strong>zombie apocalypse</strong>, helped by his <strong>crazy partner, Doc Dick,</strong> who keeps bringing him <strong>back from the dead</strong>. <strong>Action, funny loot, special gear, </strong>and lots of <strong>fun</strong> await<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist</strong> and check back often to see what disasters these two get into next!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781350?t=1770079498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/f3e042d7ed214f51dee830686305be7b06d6917f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770079498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/1d22a033fcab6091c85cfcae1dc402