ps/3781350/extras/8d64d53e61ce37092633bd9880435b3c.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose from hundreds of weapons:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee weapons</strong>\u00a0- Machetes, <strong>Katanas</strong>, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handguns</strong>\u00a0- Pistols, Revolvers, and SMGs (<strong>UZI</strong>!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assault Rifles</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>AK-47</strong>, FAMAS, M4, <strong>AUG</strong>, and many more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy weapons</strong>\u00a0- Machine Guns (<strong>MiniGun</strong>!) and Shotguns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special weapons</strong>\u00a0- Bows, Crossbows, <strong>Flamethrowers</strong>, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>So much firepower that only Jerry can carry it all\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udcaa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/5cfe9a3081e6c23c080785d5b6e0dbf3.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/67d3f9d9b771a5fa0bc1a7ecd652c629.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/67d3f9d9b771a5fa0bc1a7ecd652c629.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/67d3f9d9b771a5fa0bc1a7ecd652c629.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>twisted zombies</strong> to <strong>mutated spiders</strong> and <strong>massive horrors</strong>, every <strong>boss</strong> is a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat them</strong> to get <strong>better loot</strong>, <strong>earn experience</strong>, and <strong>unlock new areas</strong> to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The next time you face a boss, it will be <strong>tougher</strong> and may surprise you with <strong>new attacks</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/ae7894fda4e49e29cd50c63c4c77e8fb.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/a914caa1426136c4f03829fdc6ca759e.poster.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/a914caa1426136c4f03829fdc6ca759e.webm?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/a914caa1426136c4f03829fdc6ca759e.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player progres:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect XP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LV UP</strong> and\u00a0<strong>choose upgrades: attack</strong>, <strong>defense</strong>, <strong>speed</strong>\u2026 or try something completely <strong>different</strong>? <br>The <strong>choice is yours</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b