bm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/26ad33be1d9f820d82e335f8a2ab2da2.mp4?t=1770079498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your <strong>adventures</strong>, you\u2019ll <strong>find materials</strong> that allow you to <strong>craft unique equipment</strong> (<strong>Special Gear</strong>):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offensive Gear</strong> (Mines, <strong>Dynamite</strong>, and much more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong> (e.g. <strong>monkey</strong> decoys that <strong>lure</strong> zombies and give you a moment to breathe)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing Gear</strong> (Various <strong>healing</strong> items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps</strong> (e.g. slowing traps, <strong>freezing traps</strong>, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is just the beginning -\u00a0the game<strong> is packed </strong>with<strong> tons of weird and unexpected gear </strong>waiting to be<strong> discovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/extras/2f86030dd427c3f443253a6dc27408c3.avif?t=1770079498\" width=1218 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s just the beginning. Join <strong>Jerry</strong> as he fights through the <strong>zombie apocalypse</strong>, helped by his <strong>crazy partner, Doc Dick,</strong> who keeps bringing him <strong>back from the dead</strong>. <strong>Action, funny loot, special gear, </strong>and lots of <strong>fun</strong> await<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist</strong> and check back often to see what disasters these two get into next!</p>","developers":["Pocket Universe studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781350/abcad7866fa4313dde14ee41f28175838fdc871c/header.jpg?t=1770079498","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781350/247055914/405245f28b9d73672b8bb47b13d34b5d5de16067/1757284308/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758138785","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781350/247055914/405245f28b9d73672b8bb47b13d34b5d5de16067/1757284308/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758138785","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3781350/247055914/405245f28b9d73672b8bb47b13d34b5d5de16067/1757284308/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758138785","id":257194368,"name":"Jerry The Zombie Slayer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194368/a302e13066fb374590fd0f925cbf9b18657577ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758138785"}],"name":"Jerry the Zombie Slayer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 780 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Pocket Universe studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","des